@startuml
title [Scenario Name]

actor User
participant "Client Application" as Client
participant "API Service" as API
database "Application Database" as DB
queue "Work Queue" as Queue
participant "Background Worker" as Worker

User -> Client: Start [goal]
Client -> API: [HTTP request / command]
activate API

API -> API: Validate request
API -> API: Authenticate and authorize

alt [request is valid and authorized]
  API -> DB: Persist [domain record / operation]
  DB --> API: [Persisted result]
  API -> Queue: Publish [work item]
  Queue --> API: [Durable acknowledgment]
  API --> Client: [Accepted response + operation ID]
else [validation or authorization fails]
  API --> Client: [Safe error response]
end

deactivate API

... asynchronous processing occurs later ...

Queue -> Worker: Deliver [work item]
activate Worker
Worker -> DB: Load and process [operation]
DB --> Worker: [Current state]
Worker -> DB: Persist [result / status]
DB --> Worker: [Saved status]
deactivate Worker

@enduml
